1
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:50,840
Thank you, Teacher.

2
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,719
You're so kind.

3
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:53,479
Wait for me.

4
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,399
Okay.

5
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:02,880
Sir.

6
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,680
Send someone right away

7
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,599
to bring Gu Ting here.

8
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:10,280
Stay alert.

9
00:01:11,799 --> 00:01:12,680
If there's any movement,

10
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,200
let me know immediately.

11
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:15,879
Yes, Sir.

12
00:01:48,719 --> 00:01:49,879
Why is this place so remote?

13
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:50,799
Please raise your arms.

14
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,719
This way, please.

15
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:17,280
Please.

16
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:25,840
Please.

17
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,639
Sorry I'm late.

18
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,919
I know you've suffered a lot lately.

19
00:03:09,319 --> 00:03:11,360
I am not a good Teacher.

20
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:14,800
Teacher, how could I blame you?

21
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,599
Are you feeling better?

22
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:19,759
My illness is not important.

23
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:21,759
You are what matters.

24
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,879
Thank you, Teacher.

25
00:03:24,479 --> 00:03:26,120
If I hadn't met you,

26
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:28,639
I wouldn't know what to do.

27
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:31,479
Do not worry.

28
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,680
From now on,

29
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,800
no one will ever hurt you again.

30
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,840
Teacher, Teacher.

31
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,599
I'm not ready yet.

32
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:40,719
There is no rush.

33
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,039
Just knowing how I feel is enough.

34
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,800
I need to go back for my treatment now.

35
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,080
You get some rest.

36
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:50,719
Remember,

37
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,120
no matter what happens from now on,

38
00:03:54,719 --> 00:03:55,879
Teacher

39
00:03:56,719 --> 00:03:58,520
will always be by your side.

40
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,759
Teacher, Teacher.

41
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,080
Um,

42
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:05,080
could you let Li Wen go first?

43
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,360
You are my woman.

44
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:12,159
Why are you thinking about another man?

45
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,400
I refuse to accept this.

46
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,560
I'm begging you.

47
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,920
Please let Li Wen go.

48
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:21,199
I'll do anything.

49
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:22,160
Please!

50
00:04:30,399 --> 00:04:31,639
In your dreams.

51
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,319
Are you okay?

52
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,199
I can hold on.

53
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,279
You need to leave.

54
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:28,519
Yan Li could come back at any moment.

55
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:30,800
You saved me once.

56
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,079
Now I'm saving you.

57
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,240
We're even.

58
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:36,319
I already know about Sun Yao.

59
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,279
And I know I look a lot like her.

60
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:39,519
Don't worry.

61
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,279
Once I get you out of here,

62
00:06:41,879 --> 00:06:43,120
I won't bother you again.

63
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,000
I don't want to be someone else's shadow.

64
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,319
You misunderstood.

65
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,519
I never saw you as Sun Yao's replacement.

66
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:57,000
You still love Sun Yao, right?

67
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:00,839
Let's talk once we get out.

68
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,720
Did you really think you could fool me?

69
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:46,720
You've been playing us this whole time.

70
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,199
Because it was so much fun.

71
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,920
Li Wen pretended not to know you,

72
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,680
and you pretended to trust me.

73
00:07:57,319 --> 00:08:00,920
When you thought you could really get away alive,

74
00:08:01,279 --> 00:08:03,480
I would show up and catch you.

75
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,480
Now that is the fun part.

76
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,720
You despicable and shameless bastard!

77
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,120
I am your man now.

78
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:18,399
It is not very nice to speak to your own man like that, is it?

79
00:08:39,759 --> 00:08:40,960
So Sun Yao really

80
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,000
was killed by him.

81
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:57,600
Yan Li.

82
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,279
Kill me or torture me,

83
00:09:00,279 --> 00:09:01,440
do as you please.

84
00:09:02,639 --> 00:09:03,679
Just let her go.

85
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,639
You cannot leave.

86
00:09:10,039 --> 00:09:11,120
And she certainly cannot leave.

87
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:13,600
As for her life,

88
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:14,919
whether it can be spared

89
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:18,120
depends on your attitude.

90
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:58,600
Please...

91
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,480
I beg you.

92
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,960
Please.

93
00:10:08,879 --> 00:10:10,120
I beg you.

94
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:12,000
Let her go.

95
00:10:15,879 --> 00:10:17,120
Please.

96
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:19,120
Let her go.

97
00:10:36,399 --> 00:10:37,919
That shows some sincerity.

98
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,799
But it is still not enough.

99
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,399
Seeing you like this

100
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,679
makes me happier than making ten million.

101
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:06,120
Please let him go!

102
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,799
I'll do whatever you want.

103
00:11:07,799 --> 00:11:08,600
Shut up!

104
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,120
Bitch!

105
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,440
You belong to me, understand?

106
00:11:25,159 --> 00:11:26,240
Li Wen, don't!

107
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:28,080
Nobody move!

108
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,120
Even death is too good for him.

109
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,039
I want to avenge my dad too.

110
00:11:37,279 --> 00:11:38,720
But you can't let a scumbag like him

111
00:11:39,039 --> 00:11:40,559
ruin your own life.

112
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,480
I risked my life to save you.

113
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:44,320
It wasn't so you could destroy yourself.

114
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,039
If you do this,

115
00:11:46,919 --> 00:11:48,480
my dad wouldn't approve.

116
00:11:48,679 --> 00:11:50,519
And Sun Yao definitely wouldn't either.

117
00:12:03,159 --> 00:12:04,279
Put the knife down.

118
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,480
Sir, take the secret passage first.

119
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:17,720
I'll distract the police.

120
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,000
Alright.

121
00:12:26,519 --> 00:12:28,159
Li Wen.

122
00:12:31,039 --> 00:12:32,039
Let's go.

123
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:37,600
Freeze! Police!

124
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,919
Don't move! After them!

125
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:45,679
I'm right here!

126
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:48,679
Get down!

127
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,120
Stop!

128
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,360
Cuff him. Take him away.

129
00:13:02,799 --> 00:13:03,440
Move!

130
00:13:07,039 --> 00:13:08,639
How are you? Are you okay?

131
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,320
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.

132
00:13:10,759 --> 00:13:12,519
Yan Li must be heading for the border.

133
00:13:12,519 --> 00:13:13,399
Hurry, go catch him!

134
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,960
Rest assured. Leave it to us.

135
00:13:16,279 --> 00:13:16,879
Let's go!

136
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:42,480
You have to hold on.
